.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "2026-09-25" "libmyutils 1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrlen(const char *" s ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR mystrlen ()
function calculates the length of the string pointed to by
.I s
excluding the terminating null byte ('\\0').
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters in the string.
.SH AUTHOR
Ahmad Pervaiz <bsdsf24m013@pucit.edu.com>